sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant GW as Gateway
  participant ReqQ as RMQ query.requests
  participant ReplyQ as RMQ reply.{cid} (exclusiva)
  participant QW as query-worker
  participant L1 as Redis L1 (embed cache)
  participant OLM as Ollama
  participant QDR as Qdrant
  participant RRS as rerank-service
  participant L2 as Redis L2 (resp cache)
  participant SES as Redis sessão

  User->>GW: POST /query {question, top_k, session_id}
  GW->>ReplyQ: declare
  GW->>ReqQ: publish (reply_to=ReplyQ, cid)
  GW->>ReplyQ: aguarda (timeout 120s)
  ReqQ-->>QW: deliver
  Note over QW: Fase 1 — embed
  QW->>L1: GET emb:{sha(query)}
  alt L1 miss
    QW->>OLM: POST /api/embeddings
    OLM-->>QW: vetor 768d
    QW->>L1: SETEX (TTL 7d)
  end
  Note over QW: Fase 2 — retrieval top-20
  QW->>QDR: query_points(top_k=20)
  QDR-->>QW: 20 candidatos
  Note over QW: Fase 3 — rerank top-5
  QW->>RRS: POST /rerank (top_k=5)
  RRS-->>QW: 5 ordenados (id, score, text)
  Note over QW: Fase 4 — cache L2
  QW->>L2: GET resp:{sha(query+ids)}
  alt L2 hit
    L2-->>QW: resposta cacheada
  else L2 miss
    Note over QW: Fase 5 — montagem
    QW->>SES: get_history + get_summary
    QW->>QW: build_messages (system + user com preâmbulo)
    Note over QW: Fase 6 — generation
    QW->>OLM: POST /api/chat (tools=[cite_source])
    OLM-->>QW: {message, tool_calls}
    QW->>L2: SETEX (TTL 1h)
  end
  Note over QW: Fase 7 — sessão + reply
  QW->>SES: append turn
  QW->>ReplyQ: publish QueryResponse
  ReplyQ-->>GW: deliver
  GW-->>User: {answer, citations, usage, latency_ms}
